# lint-staged runs prettier over **/*.{yml,yaml}, which caught pnpm-lock.yaml:
# prettier rewrote it with double quotes, the next `pnpm install` rewrote it
# back with single quotes, and every dependency change carried an unrelated
# 11,000 line diff.
